  "description": "ASP.NET Core Identity UI for Azure Cosmos DB. Provides pre-built Login/Logout/AccessDenied Razor Pages, a RedirectToLogin Blazor component, and AddCosmosIdentityWithUI() convenience method that combines core identity registration with cookie authentication. Built on top of Benday.Identity.CosmosDb.",
